  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>The slip of a lip oil and the high-shine of a sheer tinted gloss meets the hydration of a balm. This non-sticky, lip gloss-oil hybrid keeps lips as nourished as they are glossy.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Gloss / Lip Balm & Treatment / Lip Oil</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Hyaluronic Acid: Helps to attract water and retain moisture for plump, hydrated lips.</p><p>- Jojoba Oil: A fatty acid that hydrates and nurtures dry, chapped lips.</p><p>- Shea Butter: Softens, smooths, and conditions lips.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is cruelty-free and comes in recyclable packaging.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-For more pigment and shine, dab (instead of swipe) doe foot Glossybounce onto lips.</p><p>-Glossybounce’s nurturing formula stacks seamlessly on top of lipstick. To do so, dab several dots onto the center of the lips and press together to distribute the product.</p><p>-Reapply as much as you’d like.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Recycling Instructions:<br></strong>-While Glossybounce's components are made of recyclable materials, individual components under two inches do not typically make it through the home recycling stream. To ensure your empties get recycled, recycle through Pact Collective via saiehello.com or in store at select Sephora location.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">RICINUS COMMUNIS (CASTOR) SEED OIL, OLEIC/LINOLEIC/LINOLENIC POLYGLYCERIDES, COPERNICIA CERIFERA (CARNAUBA) WAX / COPERNICIA CERIFERA CERA / CIRE DE CARNAUBA, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, POLYHYDROXYSTEARIC ACID, SILICA, SODIUM HYALURONATE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, COCOS NUCIFERA (COCONUT) OIL, HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, AQUA / WATER / EAU, STEVIA REBAUDIANA LEAF/STEM EXTRACT, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, SORBITAN OLEATE. &nbsp;[+/- MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR: TITANIUM DIOXIDE (CI 77891), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), RED 33 LAKE (CI 17200), RED 28 LAKE (CI 45410), RED 7 (CI 15850), YELLOW 5 LAKE (CI 19140), YELLOW 6 LAKE (CI 15985)].</div></details>",
