I 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), RED 33 LAKE (CI 17200), RED 28 LAKE (CI 45410), RED 7 (CI 15850), YELLOW 5 LAKE (CI 19140), YELLOW 6 LAKE (CI 15985)].</div></details>",
